{"unit":7,"items":21,"pass":15,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 7","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 7 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Comparing</h2>\n      <p>Twenty-one questions on Lessons 25&ndash;28: comparatives, superlatives, preferences, should/have to. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>15 out of 21</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u7\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Bangkok is ___ than Cairo.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">hottest</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">more hot</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">hotter</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Tokyo is ___ than Singapore.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">expensiver</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">more expensive</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">most expensive</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">My new job is ___ than my old one.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">gooder</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">more good</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">better</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Dublin is wetter ___ Paris.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">than</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">then</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">that</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">Everest is ___ mountain in the world.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">higher</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the most high</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the highest</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">She is ___ singer in the country.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">better</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the best</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the goodest</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">Antarctica is ___ place in the world.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">colder</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the coldest</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the most cold</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">Today is as cold ___ yesterday.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">as</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">like</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">than</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">I'd ___ to stay at home tonight.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">preferring</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">prefer</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">prefers</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ with you — the train is better.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">agree</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">agreeing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">am agree</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">What about ___ by train?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">going</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">go</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">You ___ carry some cash. (good idea)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">should</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">must to</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ to start work at seven. (rule)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">should</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">has</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">You ___ pay — it's free!\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">shouldn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't have to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">have to</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">You ___ take a taxi — the metro is faster. (bad idea)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">don't have to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">should</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">shouldn't</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;21</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Compare with HOT: Bangkok / Cairo<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Bangkok is hotter than Cairo.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Superlative with BIG: Almaty / city / Kazakhstan<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Almaty is the biggest city in Kazakhstan.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Say your preference: walk<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'd prefer to walk.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Say the rule: take off your shoes<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"You have to take off your shoes.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: Rio is more hot than London.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Rio is hotter than London.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: You should to have a map.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"You should have a map.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}